    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 66cca72d691584d35869012dc111b107, type: 3}
  - content: "\u0110\u1EC3 \u0110\u1EA1i Phi tao \u0111\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi m\xE0y"
    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 66cca72d691584d35869012dc111b107, type: 3}
  - content: "X Cmm \u0110\u1EA1i Phi, \u0111\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi tao c\xF2n c\u01B0\u1EDBp
      con h\xE0ng c\u1EE7a tao"
    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ea79b647b9794cda83aaaebff37fe6e, type: 3}
  - content: "Tao \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt con gh\u1EC7 c\u1EE7a m\xE0y, c\xF3 b\u1EA3n
      l\u0129nh th\xEC \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng L\u1EA1c Kh\u1EAFc nh\u1EADn
      l\u1EA1i \u0111i"
